GIVEN r IS A `Rules, terms and rates`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 87(2): the rules, terms and rates meet the requirements` r MEANS
        r's `comply with the law and fit Vietnamese practice, ethics, culture and custom`
    AND r's `the language of the rules and terms is accurate, simple and easy to understand and technical terms are defined`
    AND r's `state clearly insurable interest, object, scope and risks, the rights and duties of the policyholder and insured person, the insurer's liability, exclusions, the method of paying and the dispute provisions`
    AND r's `premium is built on statistics, corresponds to the conditions and liability and ensures solvency`

-- Dieu 87(3) and (3a). V1: an insurer must register, and the Ministry of Finance must approve, the premium
-- method of life, health and motor vehicle products, except compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle
-- owners. From V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(7)(a)): registration and approval for life and health products only;
-- for motor vehicle products (again except compulsory civil liability) a non-life insurer or foreign non-life
-- branch gives the Ministry written notice before applying or changing the method and must keep to the notified
-- method. The premium of compulsory civil liability insurance is fixed by the Government under Dieu 8(5), not here.
-- A product line the article does not name has no such requirement (the freedom of Dieu 87(1)) (fork F28).
