@ref Dieu 87 (src:1776-1782; src:law139-2025-qh15:165-178)
GIVEN m IS A `A premium method`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 87(3)-(3a): the premium method meets the requirement that applies to its product line` m MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
           THEN CONSIDER m's `product line`
                WHEN `a life insurance product`    THEN m's `registered with the Ministry of Finance` AND m's `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`
                WHEN `a health insurance product`  THEN m's `registered with the Ministry of Finance` AND m's `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`
                WHEN `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product`
                     THEN m's `notified in writing to the Ministry of Finance before it was applied or changed` AND m's `the insurer applies the method it notified`
                WHEN `compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners`
                     THEN REFUSE "the premium of compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners is fixed under Dieu 8(5); Dieu 87(3) and (3a) exclude it"
                WHEN `another non-life insurance product` THEN TRUE
           IF `the rules in force are those of V1 or later`
           THEN CONSIDER m's `product line`
                WHEN `a life insurance product`    THEN m's `registered with the Ministry of Finance` AND m's `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`
                WHEN `a health insurance product`  THEN m's `registered with the Ministry of Finance` AND m's `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`
                WHEN `a voluntary motor vehicle insurance product` THEN m's `registered with the Ministry of Finance` AND m's `approved in writing by the Ministry of Finance`
                WHEN `compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners`
                     THEN REFUSE "the premium of compulsory civil liability insurance of motor vehicle owners is fixed under Dieu 8(5); Dieu 87(3) excludes it"
                WHEN `another non-life insurance product` THEN TRUE
           OTHERWISE REFUSE "Law 08/2022/QH15 was not in force before 1 January 2023"

