@ref Dieu 87 (src:1790-1794; src:law139-2025-qh15:180-185)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 87(5): the Government's rules on the dossier, order and procedure to register or notify a premium method` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 87(5) delegates the dossier, order and procedure to the Government; its decree is not among the sources"

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 87(6): the Minister of Finance's rules on premium methods and on supplying products` MEANS
    REFUSE "Dieu 87(6) delegates the premium methods and the supply of products to the Minister of Finance; the Minister's circular is not among the sources"

